# Root-context default deny. In particular, .env*, .git, graphify-out,
# node_modules, __pycache__, *.pyc, source media, and test fixtures never enter
# the documented Novita direct/A2Vid worker build contexts.
**
!infra/
infra/*
!infra/novita/
infra/novita/*
!infra/novita/Dockerfile
!infra/novita/Dockerfile.a2vid
!infra/novita/worker.py
!infra/novita/a2vid_worker.py
!infra/novita/test_a2vid_worker.py
